__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.venv/
dist/
node_modules/
*.tsbuildinfo
src-tauri/target/
playwright-report/
test-results/
.DS_Store

# Machine-specific freshness report: it describes THIS host's installed versions against
# upstream. Committing it would make a fresh clone display another machine's drift as if
# it were their own. An absent file correctly reads as "never checked".
data/freshness.json

# Operator reasoning configuration. This names a model you run and may name an
# environment variable holding a key. It belongs on your machine, never in the repo.
reasoning.json
**/operator-key/reasoning.json

# Internal audit reports.
#
# These describe unfixed findings, operator-specific infrastructure and disclosure
# timelines. Publishing one hands an attacker a map, and the 2026-09-21 report in
# particular names the author's notification setup — the exact class of detail that
# report told us to remove from public docs. Keep them local; SECURITY.md is the
# public-facing document.
docs/AUDIT-*.md
